  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Threefold Hallelujah Over Babylon's Fall",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this I heard what sounded like the roar of a great multitude in heaven shouting:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 19:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Hallelujah!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 19:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Salvation and glory and power belong to our God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for true and just are his judgments.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 19:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He has condemned the great prostitute",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 19:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "who corrupted the earth by her adulteries.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 19:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He has avenged on her the blood of his servants.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And again they shouted:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 19:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Hallelujah!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 19:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The smoke from her goes up for ever and ever.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The twenty-four elders and the four living creatures fell down and worshiped God, who was seated on the throne. And they cried:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 19:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Amen, Hallelujah!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then a voice came from the throne, saying:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 19:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Praise our God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 19:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "all you his servants,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 19:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you who fear him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 19:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "both great and small!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I heard what sounded like a great multitude, like the roar of rushing waters and like loud peals of thunder, shouting:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 19:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Hallelujah!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 19:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "For our Lord God Almighty reigns.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us rejoice and be glad",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 19:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and give him glory!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 19:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "For the wedding of the Lamb has come,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 19:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and his bride has made herself ready.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fine linen, bright and clean,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 19:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "was given her to wear.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m",
        "vid": "REV 19:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Fine linen stands for the righteous acts of God's holy people.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the angel said to me, \"Write this: Blessed are those who are invited to the wedding supper of the Lamb!\" And he added, \"These are the true words of God.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At this I fell at his feet to worship him. But he said to me, \"Don't do that! I am a fellow servant with you and with your brothers and sisters who hold to the testimony of Jesus. Worship God! For it is the Spirit of prophecy who bears testimony to Jesus.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Heavenly Warrior Defeats the Beast",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I saw heaven standing open and there before me was a white horse, whose rider is called Faithful and True. With justice he judges and wages war.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His eyes are like blazing fire, and on his head are many crowns. He has a name written on him that no one knows but he himself.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He is dressed in a robe dipped in blood, and his name is the Word of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The armies of heaven were following him, riding on white horses and dressed in fine linen, white and clean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Coming out of his mouth is a sharp sword with which to strike down the nations. \"He will rule them with an iron scepter.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "He treads the winepress of the fury of the wrath of God Almighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On his robe and on his thigh he has this name written:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pc",
        "vid": "REV 19:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "sc"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "king of kings and lord of lords.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "REV.19.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "REV.19.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I saw an angel standing in the sun, who cried in a loud voice to all the birds flying in midair, \"Come, gather together for the great supper of God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so that you may eat the flesh of kings, generals, and the mighty, of horses and their riders, and the flesh of all people, free and slave, great and small.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I saw the beast and the kings of the earth and their armies gathered together to wage war against the rider on the horse and his army.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the beast was captured, and with it the false prophet who had performed the signs on its behalf. With these signs he had deluded those who had received the mark of the beast and worshiped its image. The two of them were thrown alive into the fiery lake of burning sulfur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rest were killed with the sword coming out of the mouth of the rider on the horse, and all the birds gorged themselves on their flesh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
